* Ideal-boundary GaN off-state reverse-conduction plug-in
* PHYSICAL BASIS: P25 states that GaN transistors conduct in reverse without
* reverse-recovery charge and explicitly identifies Modes 2' and 5'.
* NUMERICAL IDEALIZATION: P24/P25 publish no reverse-drop model. VFWD=0 and
* RON=1m are ideal/numerical boundary values, not GS61008T measured parameters.
.param DGAN_IDEAL_RON=1m
.param DGAN_IDEAL_VF=0
.model DGAN_IDEAL D(Ron={DGAN_IDEAL_RON} Roff=1T Vfwd={DGAN_IDEAL_VF})
